---
description: Project rules – read AGENTS.md before changing code
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md): workflow, definition of done, layout, module pattern, naming, API/auth/security rules, testing, and git conventions.

<!-- @setup-if orm!=none -->
- New CRUD resource: `pnpm gen:module <name> --fields "..."`, then customize. More fields later: `pnpm gen:field <module> --fields "..."`. Keep `// @gen:` markers.
<!-- @setup-endif -->
- New feature calling another API: `pnpm gen:client <name>`, then replace the example call (see AGENTS.md). Keep `// @gen:` markers.
- Provider details: [docs/providers.md](../../docs/providers.md).
- Verify every change: `pnpm verify` (`pnpm check:fix && pnpm type-check && pnpm test`).
